            <ArticleTitle>Retro-ureteral Small Bowel Herniation After Radical Cystectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.eucr.2017.07.001</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Small bowel obstruction caused by internal herniation under ureteric bands is a rare occurrence. Only 6 previous cases have been documented. This case report reviews the case of a 79-year-old male who presented to emergency with abdominal pain requiring subsequent laparotomy and release of internal herniation of bowel under ureter.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
